 ## License
 
 MIT – see `pyproject.toml` for details.
+
+### Portable browser runtime validation
+
+The local `test/browser-runtimes` branch includes MicroPython compatibility fixes:
+use the browser's existing task scheduler, close stream iterators on exit,
+restore saved themes, keep clipboard click targets before awaiting promises, and
+run Python artifact previews through `pytinctureBrowserRuntime.captureOutput`
+when provided by pytincture. Original Pyodide pages retain the legacy fallback.
+After changing JavaScript, regenerate `wapyt/pytincture-assets.json` with
+`python scripts/generate_assets_manifest.py` before building the wheel.
